Perhaps Lojban makes it easier to identify illogicality.  In particular, sorting
out attitudinals and discourse markers from propositions and logical connectors
might help, as might the varied vocabulary for causation.  I'm not sure - it's
just an idea.  And there are those useful cmavo, {k'ia} and {ni'ima} ;-)

